# Generated image derivatives — produced by the portal build (generate:og,
# generate:images) before vite copies public/ into dist. Committing them was
# the old precedent; the build owns them now.
#
# image-variants.json is deliberately NOT ignored: it is the staleness guard,
# it is ~1kB, and `test:run` only dependsOn `^build`, so tests run in parallel
# with the portal's own build. A fresh clone must have the manifest before the
# generators run or the guard cannot check anything.
apps/portal/public/og/
apps/portal/public/webtoon-covers/r/
apps/portal/public/banner/r/
